<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JCI's Brownrigg named Joel deputy chairman.</title>
<headline>JCI's Brownrigg named Joel deputy chairman.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mining house JCI Ltd announced on Tuesday that John Brownrigg had assumed position of deputy chairman of its HJ Joel Gold Mining Co Ltd and Randfontein Estates Gold Mining Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The appointment is with effect from July 21, 1997.</p>
<p>Brownrigg is chief executive of JCI's gold and uranium division.</p>
</text>
